name phfthm
category Package
revision 60735
shortdesc Goodies for theorems and proofs
longdesc This package provides enhanced theorem and proof environments
longdesc based on the amsthm original versions. It allows for hooks to
longdesc be placed, adds some default goodies and is highly
longdesc customizable. In particular, it can connect theorems to proofs,
longdesc automatically producing text such as "See proof on page XYZ"
longdesc and "Proof of Theorem 4: ...".
